          <change when="2024-12-28T18:14:52-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Commit - I've integrated BL 7.63 corrections made by P.J. Sijpesteijn. BL 3 has also recorded readings made by K. Schmidt, most of which should be probably dismissed. I don't know if they should be quoted here. Additional readings/corrections: in line 4: Ἀκα̣μ̣ο̣ύ̣σ̣α̣ι̣ α̣ὐτο̣[ =&gt; Ἀκάμου̣ Σαρ̣μάτο[υ. In line 8 the plains' location should likely be Κολοφ̣ονίο̣υ (l. Κολοφωνίου), which probably affects the completion of line 2: ἐποικί̣[ου Κολοφονίου (l. Κολοφωνίου)], cf. CPR 23.10 ἐποικίου Κ̣ο̣λ̣ο̣φωνίου. For the verso, I have the impression that the edition reads the text upside down, and the final word ends in -φίου, but I could be wrong.  </change>
